ar Walmart runs. They have different options depending on your skin's needs. I've been loving the Clean Towels Healthy Aging. As I'm getting older, I'm much more intentional about being gentle with my skin and protecting my skin's barrier. After cleansing, I use a fresh one to gently pat my face dry instead of using the same bathroom towel over and over again. They're dermatologist approved and clinically shown to support healthier skin, so it's such a simple switch that makes my skincare routine feel so much cleaner. They also have the original Clean Towels XL, Blemish Control and Sensitive Skin, so you can choose based on your skin's needs. Clean Towels by Clean Skin Club are available at Walmart, and these are definitely staying on my restock list.", "is_relevant": false, "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "DcNA1JfsIPp", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcNA1JfsIPp/", "caption": "We can\u2019t pour from a empty cup can we?? \ud83e\uddd6\ud83c\udffe\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udc95\u2728Spend some \u201cme time\u201d w/ me! Day in my life... Morning Routine... Cleaning... shopping.\n#selfcareroutine #blackmomsofinstagram #cleanhome #organizedhome #asmr", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T01:32:57.000Z", "videoDuration": 133.606171, "videoPlayCount": 7763461, "likesCount": 260185, "commentsCount": 4095, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fbhz2-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/780482142_18069705587757515_6828085453189018247_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=1&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NjgzMDQ5OTExMDg4MDIzMzE4MDY5NzA1NTg0NzU3NTE1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=SINYyVoiWrsQ7kNvwEeGjrY&_nc_oc=Ado-iO37ALG6qvSisKh2rm2dcbN4X_w78VJtVNgyKYazxNJ8DWz2pc8U_XGc4lHQPso&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fbhz2-1.fna&_nc_gid=IzbqtihdZ84Nsq7GH0j2nQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJq08IX7pdm7nqWD7tcHo_vIHvd2m2kdiaWltcOuCRUOQ&oe=6A9A1789", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fbhz2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQM_5HIIW_Phf6WilqjZf2mpZPKVtma2O53xDEUtM0LT4Z8NbnCDsgLic7IyylQcULp7WJshGJTC990M8j-zomFqPTSomfxIM1V2oUk.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdpubgepcS2M_jP-8bjCpOR0Jf2ZJxSIaimkI-pcwEVaLN5YqFmUVrC4dbM244d0ZiA&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fbhz2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=JcOqRIZ5pPoQ7kNvwGVYTI1&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTM1NzQyMDMzNjU0ODEwMiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjExLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTMzLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=c1650d577ab25fdd&_nc_&_nc_gid=IzbqtihdZ84Nsq7GH0j2nQ&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJVPNgQl1lhTLsOENI6KFE-b6Y2CNtja7S2Put_TrbnJA&oe=6A96424B", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "operation_niki", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "28179871658317331"}, "ownerUsername": "operation_niki", "ownerFullName": "Rochelle N. Stewart", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 6138375, "likes": 205293, "comments": 3505}, {"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 7763461, "likes": 260185, "comments": 4095}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "\u041c\u0430\u043b\u044f\u0440, \u043c\u0430\u043b\u044f\u0440, \u0430 \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0436\u0435 \u0442\u044b?", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Question", "adapted_script": "As-tu vraiment le temps de passer ta fin de semaine \u00e0 r\u00e9curer ta maison? Pendant ce temps-l\u00e0, ton salon accumule la poussi\u00e8re, ta cuisine attend, pis tes fen\u00eatres crient au secours. Chez M\u00e9nag\u00e9nie, on se pose juste une question : pourquoi tu ferais \u00e7a toi-m\u00eame quand on peut le faire pour toi?", "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "DcKTSB2sElj", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcKTSB2sElj/", "caption": "#CSCPartner There\u2019s just something about ending the day with a clean home and a little self-care. \ud83e\uddd6\ud83c\udffe\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\u2728\n\nI\u2019ve been adding @cleanskinclub \u2018s new Clean Makeup Wipes into my nighttime routine, and I\u2019ve been loving the Healthy Aging wipes for my skin. They\u2019re thick, gentle, and get my makeup off without the burning, tugging or sticky residue I\u2019ve always hated with traditional makeup wipes.\n\nThey\u2019re now available at @target in four options for different skin needs: Original, Blemish Control, Healthy Aging, and Sensitive Skin. I went with Healthy Aging, but you can choose the one that works best for your skin. \u2764\ufe0f\n\n#cleanskinclub", "timestamp": "2026-08-18T00:16:01.000Z", "videoDuration": 88.800003, "videoPlayCount": 467548, "likesCount": 14335, "commentsCount": 210, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/774905446_1766093837748128_6882867484019217544_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NjA2NzIyMzY3ODY5OTg3NTIyMTkyOTQ4Mjg2MTE5MjA%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fbmZyYW1lX2NvdmVyX2ZyYW1lLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=pBfnpG7T4FUQ7kNvwEPIs3J&_nc_oc=AdqicK9m7vMrGeloPUanA2TwXBggqmWrm8MwicWKANxgjicQ--L8MSuX73fOXb_3MPs&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=e3PJSD2ovoTj3Bk5XwG2UQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJ6Q0ti3o0sTtNqRie8vj_EgsJHhKrXpx45sk_94o-m0Q&oe=6A9A0D8C", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPn9rnKgm2EwER3hxPU4QbDBrSLkSWBPMzRS6EHQ26KtcAdhB9Cjrluxm7lCLh_Rw7-iDxYU2qfBAwVWdTRR2YfzFVTAkVvBwRumDE.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=LZfgZK1Zh9sQ7kNvwEa0Dd4&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MjIxOTI5MzkxMTk0NTM0NSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjEyLCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6ODgsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=b14d42f5c1da73b8&_nc_&_nc_gid=e3PJSD2ovoTj3Bk5XwG2UQ&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQLTQ2_ie5tw3jzNA23odDc48kL9xDRD1QDwZZcLfVLHKA&oe=6A963CE1", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "operation_niki", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "28233640166268476"}, "ownerUsername": "operation_niki", "ownerFullName": "Rochelle N. Stewart", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 400602, "likes": 12788, "comments": 197}, {"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 467548, "likes": 14335, "comments": 210}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Come spend the evening with me. I've been running around all day, and before I can settle down for the night, I need to get a few things done around the house. I don't know what it is, but I cannot fully relax until everything's back where it belongs. So tonight, we're doing a quick little reset. Nothing too crazy, just getting everything cleaned up and ready for tomorrow. I feel like I've gotten into such a habit of doing this at night, because waking up to a clean house just makes the next morning so much easier. And now that the house is taken care of, it's finally time for a little self-care. Clean Skin Club came out with their new Clean Makeup Wipes, and I've been absolutely loving these. I picked up the healthy aging ones from Target. They're made with normal to dry and aging skin in mind, which is definitely what I'm looking for at this stage of my skincare routine. I've never really loved traditional makeup wipes. I hate when they burn around my eyes or leave my skin feeling dry or with that weird residue afterwards. But these are so nice. They're thick and lightly textured, so they actually remove my makeup without me feeling like I have to tug and scrub at my skin. And the biggest thing for me, no burning or stinging around my eyes. My skin just feels really soft and comfortable afterward. Then I just go right into the rest of my normal nighttime skincare routine. There's something about taking those few minutes at the end of the night to take care of my skin that just feels like the final part of resetting everything, including myself. And just like that, the house is reset, my skincare is done, and your girl is officially off duty.", "is_relevant": false, "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "DcFYSqCseDk", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcFYSqCseDk/", "caption": "You know you can have bad breath through your nose right?? Let\u2019s do some skin care! \ud83e\uddd6\ud83c\udffe\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udc95\u2728\n\n #skincare #selfcare #blackmomsofinstagram #cleanhome #organizedhome", "timestamp": "2026-08-16T02:23:21.000Z", "videoDuration": 113.033333, "videoPlayCount": 770399, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 34545, "commentsCount": 525, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fyto1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/774268075_18069199607757515_2562589564507212073_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NDY4MTg4MjE3ODgwNTk4ODE4MDY5MTk5NjA0NzU3NTE1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=E9czkwKqfDUQ7kNvwGT8hbm&_nc_oc=Adq_L582V_Nv5xRRoTenft2UYs3_6t9WszPQM65kA8cFYl2-uJ70x9K1qRia51kXp5dT5QwyLeiG5en-eKj6pJCE&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fyto1-2.fna&_nc_gid=gWIH8_oGlqDyKIIRoOW_aw&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQI98NgsePne5MFWp1Tq_eARGyYoE2dnba838N0hJRFfnA&oe=6A9A0075", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fyto1-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQOgZChL6USYsqd61uWTpof6ITo16ikckcauRuebdPFp_49Gkskrnm5oOX0iru0wQFN3s3y3P7uFewj9VTlrnllSGQ2L5lmXDWEDUmk.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdrOHBu1MTl2gicAZ93hLTVfzZVfStVbESFw_JGir1aiEJBOJn_a3Lhgu8WZfpc1BmkzplgbJEXrT61Am2ockLAf&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fyto1-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Vr5bI66n57AQ7kNvwFvYJAF&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6Mjg1MTYyODIyNTIxNTMzNSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjE0LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTEzLCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=f2a280e3dbe15de0&_nc_&_nc_gid=gWIH8_oGlqDyKIIRoOW_aw&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQLt6IzQdii7gOAg0JEcNSGFXrurSTH6jnRLDr7qLjU5Vw&oe=6A9629D1", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "operation_niki", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "28022327167424021"}, "ownerUsername": "operation_niki", "ownerFullName": "Rochelle N. Stewart", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-16", "plays": 293551, "likes": 13884, "comments": 214}, {"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 675930, "likes": 30399, "comments": 469}, {"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 770399, "likes": 34545, "comments": 525}], "still_climbing": false, "is_relevant": false, "transcript": "My home isn't the only thing I like to keep clean. I also do not play about my skincare. I was on a brand trip recently, and we were running late, and I couldn't put on any makeup, but the skin was still giving. And we were cute. My besties have been asking for my skincare secrets, and ain't no gatekeeping over here. First and foremost, the water that you use on your face matters. So I use a Filter Baby filter on my faucet. Double cleansing really helps get everything, every bit of dirt and makeup off your face. I also like to use a microfoliant twice a week to sweep and polish my skin. Do y'all clean your nasal passages? You know you can have bad breath through your nose, right? Hit them entrances with a little cleanser. And all my lash girlies, be sure to keep them lashes clean. Lashes are made to keep debris out of your eyes. A lot accumulates there, including lash mites. And then when my skin is clean, I like to use a red light therapy mask to improve the firmness of my skin. We're aging, but gracefully. And beautiful skin comes from the inside out. So hydration is of utmost importance. I like to add these youthful skin electrolytes to sparkling water and also take my daily liposomal vitamin C and collagen support for healthy, glowing skin. Now for more skincare, which includes lip care. Tatcha has a duo that keeps my lips soft and supple. I like to start with my essence and lymphatic drainage tool that heats and vibrates. Eye cream is a must for the most delicate skin on your face. All good stuff that works while I sleep. My 11s won't catch me slipping. So I put some tape dots on and these micro needle patches under my eyes. And ever since I've lost 75 pounds, your girl's neck been looking a little saggy. So collagen neck mask it is. And y'all please use clean bonnets, pillowcases and sheets to prevent breakouts. Remember, self-care is filling up the cup you pour from."}, {"shortCode": "DcAUX0ls9Mc", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcAUX0ls9Mc/", "caption": "Who doesn\u2019t love a good reset? \ud83e\uddfd\ud83e\udee7\u2728 Everything nice, clean & in its place just the way I like it! \n#cleaningmotivation #blackmomsofinstagram #cleanhome #organizedhome #asmr", "timestamp": "2026-08-14T03:13:06.000Z", "videoDuration": 144.666672, "videoPlayCount": 843799, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 40574, "commentsCount": 718, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fmel15-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/774513598_18068830862757515_6890320992264432875_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ig_cache_key=Mzk2MzI1NzI3MDAzMTM0MDMxNjE4MDY4ODMwODU5NzU3NTE1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=-yUP66qhuJMQ7kNvwEavTiT&_nc_oc=AdoLDeLcjz6pvKxQHeF1gyV0kQf5fDvU_LtxHrjaaVo5HmERoKTr5fBGa3AXdsRdRpU&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fmel15-1.fna&_nc_gid=x4pqvgZw5-DvgtcozjIsQg&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIKKWrfgROGZzP7SF5-vhJVf3cwiqFN7Ag2Axyk0z4Jgw&oe=6A9A1757", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fmel15-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQM5ikFaAYtrU_9yh1ATC8rFbrgdtFoKEqFmi0-PiLTRsOXOsBWqqXrWjLkpHJJQ-yXg_UAKoPEqfeym4gD98DGkth90n1u4zTrGIAw.mp4?_nc_cat=100&_nc_oc=AdrjUWJkWe5hgdYPI88Ex19lMEE104CQ3ktGxzrTGsfuM0EUr5bbe1J7F5yAHwlNkSs&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=instagram.fmel15-1.fna